{"steam_appid":1290760,"steam_name":"Gecko Gods","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1290760/1818085627/0170244f4d528a6bf7229c5d7702fad3eb7c8b5c/1776348716/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776351609","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257320836/d4f2e307dafeadc3b019e9f9a24cfe455576bbfa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776351609","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/d019ef86676a367fbf21042157109d05a6fb89d4/ss_d019ef86676a367fbf21042157109d05a6fb89d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782911717","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/4013851e9a0017aabfcbdfe119f0425e7107bf68/ss_4013851e9a0017aabfcbdfe119f0425e7107bf68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782911717","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/e20a9dc8f390ace6e7c98a437cd416b0664fa080/ss_e20a9dc8f390ace6e7c98a437cd416b0664fa080.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782911717","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/1953358a3ead2e222057eaf656b39fdf12ac9a8d/ss_1953358a3ead2e222057eaf656b39fdf12ac9a8d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782911717","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/72d3c9d57c493ac519fb317c68e25ffded6c3034/ss_72d3c9d57c493ac519fb317c68e25ffded6c3034.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782911717"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail  in <i>Gecko Gods</i>; a serene puzzle-adventure platformer where you explore a forgotten archipelago through the eyes of a tiny gecko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb across sunlit ruins, weave through lush caves, and uncover the remnants of an ancient civilisation, all at your own pace. Each path holds something new to discover as you glide between islands on your small wooden boat, every stop offering new puzzles to solve, insects to snack on and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/86e60b6e536d9f2b7b4ab5ec2198197c.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1560 height=116 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/9984e7f8d8201c11cf275634f730bbdc.poster.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/9984e7f8d8201c11cf275634f730bbdc.webm?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/9984e7f8d8201c11cf275634f730bbdc.mp4?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>Experience a world designed for curiosity and gentle adventure, where movement itself is part of the joy.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/afb5ff6fc6d8eb7d93cdd255103d0f40.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/b15a6adc9e3f43480d935ef9bcefdba8.poster.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/b15a6adc9e3f43480d935ef9bcefdba8.webm?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/b15a6adc9e3f43480d935ef9bcefdba8.mp4?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Drift across tranquil seas to discover unique landscapes, each with its own atmosphere and hidden life.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/aa90f72cc7d1937f0800e10402edf0cb.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/092e785eb1a0de446a70b6aa91650d0d.poster.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/092e785eb1a0de446a70b6aa91650d0d.webm?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/092e785eb1a0de446a70b6aa91650d0d.mp4?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Scale walls, ceilings and cliffs with the gecko’s effortless agility</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/6d3ce8efdf9f5203809f30b35106a8c7.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/cbc30fe0ad4e144c7a7927e9e487cf39.poster.avif?t=1782911717\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/cbc30fe0ad4e144c7a7927e9e487cf39.webm?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/cbc30fe0ad4e144c7a7927e9e487cf39.mp4?t=1782911717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>Delve into ruins and temples filled with intuitive, environmental challenges.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its relaxing atmosphere and intuitive blend of open-ended exploration and fluid platforming, <i>Gecko Gods</i> invites you to experience the world through entirely new eyes, encouraging curiosity and transforming even the smallest details of its environment into moments of discovery and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and onwards<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E6750 (2 * 2660) or equivalent | AMD Athlon 64 X2 Dual Core 6000+ (2 * 3000) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Inresin"],"publishers":["Super Rare Originals","Gamersky Games"],"release_date":"Apr 16, 2026"}